ESSXSOF license summary

The combined native essxsof.ko module includes a GPL-2.0-only codec
component and is distributed under GPL-2.0-only terms with complete
corresponding source. Keep the original BSD notices for the other files.

- New host glue, desktop helper and installer scripts: BSD-2-Clause.
- SOF IPC code/headers marked BSD-3-Clause: original notices apply.
- src/essx_codec.c: GPL-2.0-only; Linux ES8316/ES8336 references credited
  in the source file.
- Intel-signed src/firmware/sof-tgl.ri: separate Intel/SOF terms.

Full terms and upstream notices are included in licenses/, src/vendor/
and src/firmware/LICENCE.Intel. They are not replaced by this summary.
The DSP firmware was not written by this project. AI assistance and
upstream references were used in development; hardware testing and project
maintenance: Gorkem Caliskan (Görkem Çalışkan).

No warranty or upstream/vendor endorsement is provided.
